 "content": "# Separator-tile summary\n\nUse this branch when full-width and full-height separator lines partition the grid into equal tiles and the output dimensions match the tile layout. Map each tile to one output cell, then use demonstrations to identify which in-tile feature or count determines that cell; do not assume every unusual cell or single marker is positive. For the demonstrated pattern with color-8 separators, 2×3 tiles containing mostly color 3 and occasional color 2, emit 1 for a tile with at least two 2s and 3 otherwise."
}

