 "content": "# Missing continuation at a grid edge\n\nUse this branch when demonstrations show color 1 marking an absent continuation at a grid edge. Compare repeated rows, bands, or motif copies to infer the expected continuation and affected cells; it may be a solid suffix or only selected motif-phase positions. Color only confirmed missing continuation cells and preserve the existing motif and unrelated cells. Check every demo's changed and unchanged cells, and select repeated copies from that evidence—not from rightmost zeros or suffix length alone."
}

